{"ref":"BDB, שִׁמְעָא","hw":"שִׁמְעָא","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁמְעָא</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  brother of David <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:21\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.21\">2 S 21:21</a> Qr (cf. Dr; Kt <span dir=\"rtl\">שמעי</span>) Σεμεει, 𝔊L Σαμαα, = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 20:7\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.20.7\">1 Ch 20:7</a>, third son of Jesse <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:13\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.13\">1 Ch 2:13</a>; = <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁמְעָה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 13:3\" href=\"/II_Samuel.13.3\">2 S 13:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 13:32\" href=\"/II_Samuel.13.32\">32</a>, Σαμα(α), etc., <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁמָּה</span> (q.v.) <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 16:9\" href=\"/I_Samuel.16.9\">1 S 16:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:13\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.13\">17:13</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  son of David <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:5\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.5\">1 Ch 3:5</a> (= <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁמּוּעַ</span> <strong>1</strong>), Σαμαν, Σαμαα.<br><strong>3.</strong>  Levites, Σομεα, Σαμα(α): <strong>a.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:15\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.15\">1 Ch 6:15</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  v <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:24\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.24\">24</a>.","next":"BDB, שִׁמְעָה","prev":"BDB, שָׁמָע"}